00:03:28.499 --> 00:03:30.043
confirming it happened.

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:30.919
And and

00:03:30.919 --> 00:03:32.086
I think it'll be really interesting

00:03:32.086 --> 00:03:33.046
to find out

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:34.380
whether DOJ, whether

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.798
the five people that sat in the room

00:03:35.798 --> 00:03:37.217
