00:03:37.217 --> 00:03:39.928
have threads of text messages

00:03:39.928 --> 00:03:41.721
or emails where they comment about that.

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:43.056
So we're going to want some discovery

00:03:43.056 --> 00:03:44.933
about just how far ranging

00:03:44.933 --> 00:03:45.975
this criminal activity

00:03:45.975 --> 00:03:46.976
was by a prosecutor.

00:03:46.976 --> 00:03:48.645
And think of the irony once again.

00:03:48.645 --> 00:03:50.230
You've got prosecutors saying

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:51.606
we're going after this guy

00:03:51.606 --> 00:03:52.815
because of obstruction.

00:03:52.815 --> 00:03:53.107
You know,

00:03:53.107 --> 00:03:55.068
that's their theoretical distinction

00:03:55.068 --> 00:03:55.985
from Delaware.

00:03:55.985 --> 00:03:58.154
While they literally obstructed justice,

00:03:58.154 --> 00:04:00.281
they literally tampered with a witness

00:04:00.281 --> 00:04:01.866
in the fall of 20, 22.

00:04:01.866 --> 00:04:03.201
Let's get back to the indictment here.

00:04:03.201 --> 00:04:04.118
We don't have any evidence

00:04:04.118 --> 00:04:05.203
