00:04:37.026 --> 00:04:37.986
And so we got an email

00:04:37.986 --> 00:04:39.195
that basically had a summons,

00:04:39.195 --> 00:04:40.613
an invitation to have a call

00:04:40.613 --> 00:04:42.490
to kind of work on some of the logistics.

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:43.908
And we'll work on those logistics.

00:04:43.908 --> 00:04:45.159
There's a lot to kind of figure out

00:04:45.159 --> 00:04:47.328
