00:05:20.111 --> 00:05:21.487
Yeah, it's a combination of things.

00:05:21.487 --> 00:05:21.863
I mean, look,

00:05:21.863 --> 00:05:22.363
anytime

00:05:22.363 --> 00:05:23.323
